  "alternateName": [
    "Brief Hospital Course Summarization"
  ],
  "description": "Dataset and benchmark for hospital-course summarization — generating the 'brief hospital course' narrative of a discharge summary from the rest of a patient's record — with code to evaluate large language models on the task. MIT-licensed, from Stanford University. Published in JAMIA 2024 ('A dataset and benchmark for hospital course summarization with adapted large language models'). Built on MIMIC-IV clinical notes (the MIMIC-IV-Ext-BHC dataset on PhysioNet), so use of the underlying data is subject to PhysioNet credentialing.",
  "url": "https://github.com/StanfordMIMI/clin-bhc-summ",
